    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that but it feels so fake. like, i see the truth. i'm just a burden. everyone is just being polite because they have to be. if i actually disappeared, i think people would just feel relieved that they dont have to deal with me anymore. it honestly feels like a mercy for them.",
